      }, {
        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "CAMPARI2 PC for screening was performed in 60 mm plates by lighting with 365, 385 420 nm Led light (Cholis High-Power Led source (Thorlabs) for 3 minutes at 25mW/cm2. We then FACS sorted the low 10% photoconverted cells,"
      }, {
