          "value" : "EFO_0004170"
        } ]
      }, {
        "name" : "Description",
        "value" : "gDNA was amplified using a two step PCR. First PCR used all the gDNA in different reactions using Fw: AAT GGA CTA TCA TAT GCT TAC CGT AAC TTG AAA GTA TTT CG and Rv: TCT GCT GTC CCT GTA ATA AAC CCG AAA ATT TTG AA primers."
